  "informal_statement": "Arithmetic core of IMO 2014 Problem 2.\n\nIf `q` is the least positive integer whose square reaches `n`\nand `k=q-1`, then\n\n* `k² < n`;\n* `n ≤ (k+1)²`;\n* `n-k+1 > k(k-1)+1`;\n* every `m` with `m²<n` satisfies `m≤k`.\n\nThis is the numerical content behind\n\n    k = ⌈√n⌉ - 1.",
